# Scratchpad for hitting the API from an IDE HTTP client.
# Copy to api.http (gitignored) and fill in a real token.
#
# Get a token: log in through the UI and copy it out of localStorage,
# or POST /api/users/login/email with your own credentials.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@token = <paste a JWT here>

### Current user
GET {{host}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List skills
GET {{host}}/api/skills

### Admin: update a user's balance and rating
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/users/<user-uuid>
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "balance_minutes": 120,
  "rating": 5.0,
  "phone_number": "+100000000000"
}
